UnitPoolFactoryIndexation::TokenIndexPaginated
├── when end is lt or eq start
│   └── it reverts with EndLeqStart
└── when end is gt start
    ├── when end is gt array length
    │   └── it reverts with Panic(0x32)
    └── when end is leq array length
        └── it returns elements from tokenIndex set from start (inclusive) to end (exclusive)
